<title>USA: Heinz to detail reorganization on March 14.</title>
<headline>Heinz to detail reorganization on March 14.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH, Penn. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.J. Heinz Co on Wednesday said it would announce plans for its worldwide reorganization on March 14 at a meeting of security analysts in San Francisco.</p>
<p>The food products company also said that it would release its third-quarter results the same day before the meeting, which is scheduled to begin at 0900 local time (1200 EST/1700 GMT).</p>
